# Studiobook environment.
#
# For a zero-setup local run, skip all of this and use the seeded in-memory
# backends instead:  USE_FAKE_BACKENDS=1  (see `pnpm dev:fake`).

# --- Persistence (Cloudflare D1) ---
# D1 access is a Worker binding, not an env var — `next dev` resolves it
# locally via Miniflare (see next.config.ts), and `wrangler.jsonc` declares the
# binding for deploys. Nothing to set here.

# --- Email (Resend) ---
# Optional locally (no email is sent without it). Required to send for real.
RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_api_key
STUDIOBOOK_FROM_EMAIL=Studiobook <hello@yourdomain.com>

# --- Dev session cookie (magic-link stub) ---
STUDIOBOOK_SESSION_SECRET=change-me-in-real-deployments

# --- Fake backends: seeded in-memory repositories + fake email (no D1) ---
# USE_FAKE_BACKENDS=1
